Summary:
During today’s session, we focused on verifying the overall functionality of the Developer Portfolio Evaluator application. The frontend, backend, and database components were tested together to ensure proper integration. Multiple test cases were executed to validate data flow between the user interface, server, and database. The application was reviewed to confirm that all features were working as expected without any issues.

Outcomes:
By the end of the session, the system was confirmed to be functioning correctly across all components. The frontend displayed data accurately, the backend handled requests efficiently, and the database operations were working as intended. Successful testing ensured smooth communication between all parts of the application. Overall, the project was validated as stable and ready for further enhancements or deployment.
